      "description": "<p>A large arcane sigil carved into sandstone tile glows with a sapphire hue.</p>",
      "disable": "<p>Thievery DC 28 (expert) to erase the rune (requires thieves' tools and two successes), or <em>dispel magic</em> (5th level; counteract DC 29) to counteract the rune</p>",
