        "remaster": false,
        "title": ""
      },
      "reset": "<p>After 10 minutes of the sultan no longer being in danger, the sigil destroys its currently summoned elemental and resets.</p>",
      "routine": "<p>(1 action) the sigil commands its summoned water elemental, giving it two actions (the water elemental does not have its own initiative). If the sigil's summoned water elemental was destroyed, it summons a new one instead (of the same type listed in the Defend the Sultan! reaction), but can't command it until next turn.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Any creatures summoned by the Marid summoning sigil lose the Water-Bound ability if they have it.</span></p>"
